    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>ZOOM</i></strong> is a fast-paced, silly FPS that combines shooter elements from <i>Doom (2016) </i>and <i>Ultrakill</i> and strategy mechanics similar to <i>Neon White</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The zoo animals have taken over the zoo and are mad with hunger! It is up to you, the new guy on the job, to satiate their hunger with your state-of-the-art goo-feeding gun and figure out what's going on.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your impressive mobility and skills from your scanner gun to traverse areas/arenas and avoid unique attacks from enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scan enemies to change your skill set and gun type, and reload ammo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with the environment to strategically deal with enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the unique zoo environment with solar punk visual design influences</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>ZOOM</i></strong> is a fast-paced, silly FPS that combines shooter elements from <i>Doom (2016) </i>and <i>Ultrakill</i> and strategy mechanics similar to <i>Neon White</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The zoo animals have taken over the zoo and are mad with hunger! It is up to you, the new guy on the job, to satiate their hunger with your state-of-the-art goo-feeding gun and figure out what's going on.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your impressive mobility and skills from your scanner gun to traverse areas/arenas and avoid unique attacks from enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scan enemies to change your skill set and gun type, and reload ammo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with the environment to strategically deal with enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the unique zoo environment with solar punk visual design influences</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "ZOOM is a fast-paced silly FPS with strategic gun and skill swapping. Play as an FBI (Feeding Beasts Intelligence) Agent and navigate zoo exhibits to satiate the hunger of the animals and stop their angry uprising with your special food gun!",
